@startuml
actor Client
participant "Trusted Host" as Host
participant CORS
participant "Security Headers" as Headers
participant "Size Limit" as Size
participant "Redis Rate Limit" as Rate
participant "Request Context" as Auth
participant Route
Client -> Host: HTTPS request
Host -> CORS: trusted host
CORS -> Headers: allowed origin/method
Headers -> Size: add response policy
Size -> Rate: Content-Length accepted
Rate -> Auth: quota accepted
Auth -> Route: signed token + active role context
Route --> Client: response + request/correlation IDs
@enduml
